"],["pc","cqccc"],["pg",""],["hs","ncwcsc"],["at","West wins the second round of clubs "],["pg",""],["ls","ncwcsc"],["pc","ctccjc"],["pg",""],["hs","wsss"],["at","and plays a second spade to South's @SK. "],["pg",""],["ls","ssws"],["pc","stsss"],["pg",""],["hs","scwc"],["nt","With the lead conveniently placed in the South hand, clubs can be established by knocking out the remaining honor. "],["pg",""],["ls","scwc"],["pc","c9cdd"],["pg",""],["hs","ws"],["at","West is welcome to cash his 3 spade winners, "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["hs","nhshsc"],["at","but South will later by able to get to his hand with the @HK in order to enjoy 3 more club tricks. South will actually end up with an overtrick as a result of his careful play to the first trick."],["",""]]}}